    ("bbr-no-universal-fairness", "BBR path model has no universal fairness guarantee", "Estimated bandwidth and minimum RTT can be distorted by competing traffic and path changes; original BBR's mechanisms do not establish equal bandwidth sharing with every flow or controller.", "bbr-min-rtt"),
